Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.37,0:00:06.00,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,5000,5700)\pos(650.323,447.855)}Episode 56\N\N\N\N\N\NMount Dìngjūn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:15.88,Thinking,,0,0,0,,As instructed by Liu Bei, Zhang Fei and Ma Chao \Ngarrisoned in Baxi and Xiabian to capture Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:20.29,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao feared that Xiahou Yuan and Zhang He's forces were too weak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:25.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and sent Cao Hong with\N fifty thousand troops to bolster the defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:29.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When Cao Hong arrived at Hanzhong, he had Xiahou Yuan and Zhang He
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.91,Thinking,,0,0,0,,observe critical junctures to defend against Zhang Fei and Ma Chao.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:35.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,4050,4380)\pos(870.618,482.727)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:40.48,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhang He petitioned to fight and kill Zhang Fei, \Ntake Baxi, and open the way to Shu Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:33.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,4050,4260)\pos(958.4,372.8)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Zhang Fei, am here! \NWhere can you run now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:01:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, our camp is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are our reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not coming! They were\Ndefeated by our General Wei Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:24.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,6580,6860)\pos(550.667,440)}Cáo Hóng\NStyled: Zǐlián
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He went to fight against my instructions!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.77,0:02:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that he is beaten back to Wakou, he wants my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to Wakou Pass and press him to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come, eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:41.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,9060,9420)\pos(985,501.333)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have thought of a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go to the back of Wakou Pass to find a small path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,General, your intention being?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But the back of Wakou Pass is just cliffs and crags!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no paths to use!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This path ends right here,\N it does not reach the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The seizure of Wakou Pass depends on those civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite those civilians.\NDo not intimidate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General, here they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-General!\N-General!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing? Where were you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We are Hanzhong people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Last year, we came here to work. We wish to return home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you use the official roads?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have heard of armies clashing,\Nall roads in Langzhong are blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We are taking a detour through this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this path lead to Hanzhong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this path lead to Wakou Pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakou Pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This path goes to Mount Zitong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,On Mount Zitong, there is a small path to Wakou Pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's hard to go through and few people know about it, even among the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know of this path?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I once went through it to pick herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold off on returning home. \NCome with me to my camps for a drink first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come come come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, General Wei will lead a unit to attack the pass from the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead five hundred light cavalry with the civilians as guide
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.36,0:05:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and get to the back of Wakou Pass by the small path.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,General, there isn't much food left \Nin the pass. The troops are disgruntled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At this pace, defense will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't the reinforcements from Nanzheng here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,General, behind this mountain is Wakou Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,General, we are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,General, Wei Yan is challenging us at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan challenging?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.25,0:07:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Set the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Set the fire!\N-Set the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.33,0:08:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-General!\N-General, there is fire behind the pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.89,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know the approaching army!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.87,0:08:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,General, could it be Zhang Fei's troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Impossible!\N-Not without divine meddling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He, you lout, get down and face your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He, you lout!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has Wakou Pass now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of thirty thousand troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,how many men remain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to not go,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you insisted, boasting for a military pledge to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now? You lost the camp, the pass, and all the troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have repaid with your life! Why are you here!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him out, off with his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.57,0:10:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,General, recruiting men is easy, but finding an officer is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Zhang He is guilty, he is a\N general valued by the Prince of Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He cannot be executed lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cao, you can give him \Na detachment to take Jiameng Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep the army of the Riverlands in check.\N Thus, Hanzhong can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Should he fail, he may \Nbe punished for those two crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you five thousand troops to take Jiameng Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail again, I will not be lenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General, for your mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Yide has been reporting triumphs: He took \NWakou Pass through wit and routed Zhang He.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}All the credit goes to the Strategos' eye for talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}He is both brave and sly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}His extraordinary accomplishments are due to your good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}With Wakou Pass taken, the Langzhong line is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}My Lord, Strategos,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}General Huo Jun of Jiameng Pass has sent a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:22.55,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.333,448)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Zhang He has come to attack Jiameng Pass again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Huo Jun wrote to ask for immediate reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Which general in our tent \Nshould go defeat Zhang He?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:42.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(979.835,502.4)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}There is one man who is suitable for this task, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, as I see it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:12:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Jiameng Pass is the most critical passage of the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Today, it is being attacked by Zhang He,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord8)}thus Yide should be sent to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Strategos, General Zhang is garrisoned in Wakou, defending Langzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}They are areas of importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}He shouldn't be deployed. It is better to pick an officer from this tent...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He is a famed general of Wei. He cannot be easily matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than Yide, nobody here can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:30.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.667,481.333)}Huáng Zhōng\NStyled: Hànshēng
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, why do you look down on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I have mediocre talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to behead Zhang He and dedicate it to our banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hansheng is brave, but what a pity he is too old.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear he cannot match Zhang He.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be old,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but my arms can still draw a three-{\i1}dàn{\i0} bow
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:54.80,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,1 {\i1}dàn{\i0}（石）≈ 30 kg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and I still have the strength of a thousand {\i1}jīn.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:57.06,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,1 jīn（斤）≈ 223 g around this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these not enough to block Zhang He, that nobody?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Huang, you are nearing seventy years of age. How is that not old?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Glaive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:32.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1001.333,461.333)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Elder General Huang is no worse than in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good. He still has a few tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No worse than in the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:20.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(278.667,473.333)}Fǎ Zhèng\NStyled: Xiàozhí
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine strength, Elder General!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.79,0:14:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bit worse than in the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Huang, please allay your fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, do I look like someone who can defeat Zhang He?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are willing to go, who should be your deputy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Yan can go with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If any negligence arises, \Ntake our two white heads first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.84,0:15:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I admire the bravery of you two elderly generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I order you two to lead ten thousand troops towards Jiameng Pass tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your choice of generals might be inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, do say what is on your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.37,0:15:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiameng Pass is critical to us. If it is lost, Yi province will be in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.15,0:15:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He is favored by Cao Cao and his martial prowess is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:16:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wouldn't choosing old generals \Nagainst such an enemy be very frivolous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you believe those two are old and incapable?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I foresee that Hanzhong will\N be taken by those two old generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:18.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Huang Zhong, who had his troops feign arrogance,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:21.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}lost three camps on purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:26.83,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}luring Cao generals Han Hao and Xiahou Shang to overstretch with their isolated force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has no one under his tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:41.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,7110,7470)\pos(248.358,361.364)}Hán Hào
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:41.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,7110,7470)\pos(964.8,494.4)}Xiàhóu Shàng\NStyled: Bórén
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He sent these two old geezers onto the battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:46.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong made a sneak attack on the Wei camps at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:49.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,seizing a great amount of supplies and horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:51.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The Wei army retreated for tens of {\i1}lǐ.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:52.20,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,1 {\i1}lǐ{\i0}（里）≈ 417m at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:56.93,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhang He's rear army fled with the defeated troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:03.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong, advancing his troops, regained three camps and seized Mount Tiandang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:06.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the fall of the 23rd year of the Jian'an era,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:06.68,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,218 CE.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:10.92,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei led a great army of 100,000 \Nwith Zhuge Liang as chief strategist
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:17.31,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and with Zhang Fei and Zhao Yun as vanguards.\N Through Jiameng Pass, they went to seize Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is leading 100,000 troops to take Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.18,0:17:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is willing to lead our soldiers to defend against the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,such a major task may not \Nbe accomplished by our generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What esteemed opinions do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Liu Bei has long had an eye for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}After taking the Riverlands, he strived to govern well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Now, he leads a great army to invade Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}His intention is, indeed, to move into the Central Plains!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}As it is, the battle for Hanzhong is of utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Should Hanzhong be lost, \Nthe Central Plains will be demoralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Your Highness, do not decline this burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}You must personally lead an army there to subdue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.31,0:18:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}I regret that when I first subdued Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}I did not heed you and attacked Shu in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Thus, we would not have this conundrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gentlemen.\N-Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall lead a great army to subdue them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am leading a great force to take Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports say that Cao Cao, too, is leading an army, one of 100,000, to Nanzheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao too is leading troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-How many soldiers?\N-Hundreds of thousands!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:19:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks like it'll be another fierce battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Mount Dingjun is the barrier of Nanzheng
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}and is also where the enemy's supply depot is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Should Mount Dingjun be seized, Nanzheng will be in our hands
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}and the Yangping route will be secured!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Elder General Huang!\N-Present!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.60,0:19:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you dare to take Mount Dingjun also?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare so!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Though Elder General Huang is valiant,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Xiahou Yuan, who is better than Zhang He, is defending Mount Dingjun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Xiahou Yuan has experience in strategy and leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}In the past, Cao Cao sent him to Chang'an to resist Ma Chao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Today, he is garrisoned at Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Cao Cao entrusted this task only to Xiahou Yuan due to his abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Although you defeated Zhang He,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}that is no guarantee of defeating Xiahou Yuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}This battle is critical!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}I will send someone to Jing to fetch\N General Guan to lead this campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Why do you belittle me like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}General, your bravery is commendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}What a pity you are nearing seventy years of age! It is better for you not to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Lian Po was eighty years of age!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:31.78,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Lián Pō (廉{\fs31}颇{\fs}, c. 327 BCE – 243 BCE): A general of the state of Zhào of the Warring States. \NHe was one of the Four Great Generals of the Warring States, along with Bai Qi, Wang Jian and Li Mu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Yet, he still ate one {\i1}dǒu{\i0} of rice and ten {\i1}jīn{\i0} of meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}All the other states feared his valor and dared not attack Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}What more is there to say\N when I am not even seventy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}In this trip, I will behead Xiahou Yuan and present it to our standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So you insist on going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who will be your deputy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for a deputy. \NA detachment of 3,000 will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:20:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.78,0:21:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send someone as the Army Supervisor to accompany you. How is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will have Fa Zheng help you. \NHe will help should an issue arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,General Huang, Xiaozhi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.76,0:21:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,be cautious and do not let your guard down in the campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were not to rouse the old general with a few words,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.63,0:21:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he might not even win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A regiment should be reserved to aid him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Zilong.\N-Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.71,0:21:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay an ambush at the south side of Mount Dingjun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If General Huang wins, stand down.\N If something happens, reinforce him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.07,0:21:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Yan.\N-Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.24,0:22:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard the pass at Langzhong to allow\N Generals Zhang Fei and Wei Yan to take Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Liu Feng.\N-Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.33,0:22:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead 3,000 men to strategic points in the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,raising many banners as if you had a great army to instill fear to the foe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and aid General Huang in victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, heed your orders. \NNo mistakes are to be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.01,0:22:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.30,0:22:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He has lost again! His crime-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He has done nothing wrong! \NVictory and loss are common in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Liu Bei has sent \NHuang Zhong to attack Mount Dingjun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiahou Yuan has heard that you are encamped at Nanzheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so he is holding his ground, \Nnot leaving to engage in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not fighting is showing weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.10,0:22:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Command him to advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.26,0:22:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.41,0:22:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,With his temper, he might fall for evil plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.18,0:23:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I will write to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.12,0:23:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple challenges, and yet Xiahou Yuan does not leave his defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we make a full assault,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.78,0:23:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the mountain paths are too dangerous and the enemy is too unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense is the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.16,0:23:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiahou Yuan not leaving \Nhis defense is a show of his forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.70,0:23:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be lured out to fight in order to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.74,0:23:45.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,360,4900,5220)\pos(331.19,460.994)}Xiàhóu Yuān\NStyled: Miàocái
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.54,0:23:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the messenger rest well!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.30,0:23:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}I am styled "Miaocai."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:58.34,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Miàocái (妙才) lit. "Marvelous ability"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.15,0:24:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}The Prince of Wei told me not to sully its meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Tomorrow, I will go down the mountain \Nand capture Huang Zhong for the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Mount Dingjun is a major supply depot, the lifeline of Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.07,0:24:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}If any issues arise, Hanzhong will be in peril. \NPlease reconsider, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Can we win glory by holding this position?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.74,0:24:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}General, Huang Zhong is a clever man
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.46,0:24:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}and he has the aid of Fa Zheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.94,0:24:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}They are not to be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.40,0:24:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}With treacherous mountain paths, we only need to fortify.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.54,0:24:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}He is almost seventy years old; what is there to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.74,0:24:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}If we sit and wait for others to beat us to glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.42,0:24:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}how can we show our faces to the Prince of Wei?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.82,0:24:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.64,0:24:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Tomorrow, you will guard the mountain when I attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.22,0:24:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.59,0:24:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uncle, Huang Zhong is but an \Nold man with one leg in the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.64,0:24:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why do you need to go to the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.73,0:24:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am worthy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.44,0:24:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.73,0:25:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you 3,000 soldiers to challenge him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.54,0:25:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you meet Huang Zhong, seek defeat, not victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.34,0:25:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,for I have my own plan to capture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.26,0:25:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.56,0:25:15.16,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Old fool Huang, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.86,0:25:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, the Cao army is challenging us below the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.81,0:25:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.73,0:25:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder general need not go, \NI will face the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.66,0:25:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.30,0:25:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.76,0:25:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenger, your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.44,0:25:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Xiahou Shang, a major general under Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:41.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334.549,488.485)}Chén Shì
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.40,0:25:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Xiahou Yuan would come!\NInstead, a nobody is going to his death!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.31,0:25:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,En garde!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.13,0:26:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Retreat!\N-Chase them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.95,0:26:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You nobody, where are you running to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.83,0:26:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General, Chen Shi went into a valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.02,0:26:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but was ambushed and captured by Xiahou Yuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.13,0:27:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Decamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.26,0:27:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.57,0:27:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.79,0:27:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,General Xiahou!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.13,0:27:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.06,0:27:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Huang Zhong decamped today. His army \Nadvanced about ten {\i1}lǐ{\i0} towards Mount Dingjun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.32,0:27:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}He has encamped and decamped five times each.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.56,0:27:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Now he is only five {\i1}lǐ{\i0} away from our main camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.56,0:27:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Uncle, Huang Zhong is inching ever forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.57,0:27:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}If we don't fight, I'm afraid we'll be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.78,0:27:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}General, Huang Zhong is using\Nthe plan of "Reversing the Host and Guest."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.78,0:27:58.87,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,The plan is where the inferior side subverts the superior side, thus reversing their roles,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.13,0:28:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}trying to lure us into abandoning \Nour defenses to attack! Do not sally forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.25,0:28:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}General Zhang, that old geezer Huang Zhong is insatiable. How can our army not fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}You did not attack when you were at Wakou.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.54,0:28:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}If you only did, then would we have this problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.95,0:28:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.50,0:28:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}The senile Huang Zhong has gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.04,0:28:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}Host or guest, how is \Nthat seventy year old man worth fearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.34,0:28:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Boren!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.22,0:28:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.92,0:28:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take five thousand troops! \NChallenge Huang Zhong at his camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.19,0:28:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.76,0:28:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General Xiahou.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.86,0:28:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Report at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.13,0:28:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The general met Huang Zhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.62,0:28:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but was captured alive by \NHuang Zhong only after one round!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.02,0:29:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send someone to Huang Zhong's camp
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.12,0:29:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to negotiate exchanging Chen Shi for the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.33,0:29:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.66,0:29:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.97,0:30:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.50,0:30:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.01,0:30:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, General, no!\N-Let go, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.20,0:30:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,General, Huang Zhong is baiting you!\N Do not fall for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.38,0:30:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let go!\N-General!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.05,0:30:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.31,0:31:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring the bell, ring the bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why ring the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.10,0:31:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,General Xiahou, there's Shu soldiers moving towards Mount Dingjun!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.53,0:31:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Return to the main camp and stand by!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.27,0:31:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaozhi, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.24,0:31:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.56,0:31:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,, I saw a tall mountain to the west of Mount Dingjun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.75,0:31:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have seen that mountain as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.56,0:31:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Standing at its peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.49,0:31:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,all activity near Mount Dingjun will be visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.53,0:32:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you take this mountain, \NMount Dingjun will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.40,0:32:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan that can capture Xiahou Yuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.71,0:32:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.98,0:32:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}We should take over the mountain at the second watch tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.98,0:32:17.28,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,9-11 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.28,0:32:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}Tomorrow, Xiahou Yuan will come to take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.16,0:32:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}You will then defend the mountainside.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.62,0:32:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}I will be at the peak to await him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.71,0:32:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}When I hold the white flag as a signal, you will stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.37,0:32:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}When they are tired, I will hold a red flag,\N signaling you to descend and attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.41,0:32:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}With a rested army attacking an exhausted foe, victory is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.31,0:32:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A great strategy indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.46,0:32:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}As the military books say,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.02,0:32:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11}"There is zeal at dawn, laxity at noon, and the will to retreat in the evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.65,0:32:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11\pos(640,665)}We will attack them when they feel lazy at noon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.14,0:32:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! I will adopt your plan, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.48,0:33:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, Huang Zhong has seized the western mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.00,0:33:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong, you old man, I must cut you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.14,0:33:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, this must be Fa Zheng's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.42,0:33:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We must keep on our position, we cannot attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.84,0:33:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on, keep on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.32,0:34:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Shu soldiers laid ambushes all over Mount Dingjun!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.42,0:34:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With Huang Zhong taking the western mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.56,0:34:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,all our movements will be under his eyes! How will we defend?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.79,0:34:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-General!\N-General!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.19,0:34:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind is set! Tomorrow, we retake the western mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.83,0:34:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.04,0:34:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.21,0:35:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huáng, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.91,0:35:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiahou Yuan is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.07,0:35:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.11,0:35:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.31,0:35:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,White flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.99,0:35:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.51,0:36:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong, you senile!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.94,0:36:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down and meet your death at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.44,0:36:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down and meet your death at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.88,0:36:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.98,0:36:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare occupy our western mountain? Return it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.41,0:36:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong, you senile!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.81,0:36:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down and meet your death at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.40,0:36:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, hurry and come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.38,0:36:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong, you senile!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.87,0:36:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare occupy our western mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.83,0:37:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong, you senile, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.23,0:37:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down and meet your death! Hurry and come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.37,0:37:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong, you senile!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.74,0:37:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse him! Keep on cursing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.05,0:38:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.19,0:38:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Red flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.69,0:38:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang, red flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.63,0:38:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.65,0:39:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mount the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.77,0:39:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiahou cur, hand over your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.11,0:39:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.62,0:39:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Descend!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.74,0:39:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Descend!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.05,0:39:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All credit goes to Fa Zheng and his great plan!

